-      "interpretation": "Compare identity_delta to ondisk_delta. The mask raising a ZERO-KNOWLEDGE engine's score by more than a real engine's is the laundering signature, and it is why arm A1 (mask-only) must be labelled 'admits more, INCLUDING degenerates' rather than 'measures better'. REQ-ARC-WMTE-6015's swallow guard removes the worst mechanism (a mask that deletes the game, under which the identity engine is optimal) but does not by itself make the mask neutral.",
-      "why_never_negative_is_a_STRUCTURAL_INVARIANT_not_a_result": "Masking can only DELETE cells from a comparison, so an exact-match count can only rise. A negative delta would be a BUG. This check is therefore a bug-detector whose passing value is guaranteed by the code path -- it is NOT an acceptance witness, because it has no reachable failing value on correct code, and presenting it among the gates would be a pass that could not have failed."
