-    "why_the_field_is_present_anyway": "submitted_value_weight is recorded as PROVENANCE -- the parity-relevant config every arm actually ran with, read from the same SUBMITTED_VALUE_WEIGHT helper the baseline used. Removing it to dodge a linter would delete real evidence that the measured agent was the submitted config.",
