+  "recheck_coverage": "All 7 win-carrying cells (every cell that could move the headline rate) plus 3 non-winners as an over-fire control, so a spuriously-appearing NEW win would also have been caught. first_win, reached_level, actions and actions_to_first_levelup all bit-identical on 10/10.",
