+  "answer_from_bounds_alone": "THE BOUND IS TOO WIDE TO ANSWER THE HEADLINE QUESTION. Per cell the worst case erases between 0% and 95.7% of the offline score (median 11.4%), and its best case is 0% BY CONSTRUCTION -- so bounds alone can establish neither that the optimism is material nor that it is negligible. This is a real answer, and it is exactly what justifies the per-level instrumentation in Part B.",
